    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Loading Checklist:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify that the bike is upright on a padded dolly, straps are tightened, and protective covers are in place. Confirm that the moving crew—whether packers and movers Dattawadi Pune or packers and movers near Kharadi Pune—has documented the pre‑load audit and signed off on each safety measure.</p>
