    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If you are transferring the ownership of a vehicle alongside your household goods, a clear photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC) is mandatory. This document must be self-attested by the owner. It serves as legal proof of ownership and is required by the transport authorities to verify the vehicle's registration status before it crosses state borders.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
