</div>
<p>A critical component of the insurance certificate is the coverage amount. You must opt for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This specific type of coverage ensures that you are compensated for the full market value of your items, not just a percentage or a fixed sum.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Marine transit insurance explicitly covers goods in transit via road, which is the standard mode for Bhopal-to-Pune moves.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By declaring the full value of your household contents, you eliminate the risk of under-insurance, providing total financial protection against total loss or partial damage.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Professional movers will facilitate this process, but it is your responsibility to review the policy terms to ensure full compliance.</span></li></ul></div>
